# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the map. Open the one row that matches the task, then implement.

- Change only what the user asked. Leave the next sprint deliverable untouched.
- Record a transcript, timing, citation, or test result only from a run in this session.
- Keep `GEMINI_API_KEY` in the process environment.
- When the task needs the microphone, stop and ask the user to speak.

Do not search sibling repositories or the web to rediscover the stack.
